; id: IMPL-028
; title: Compact checkpoint continuation proof and native-kernel boundary audit
; status: formal verification in progress
; tier: 1
; Governing law: [[SPEC-035-cached-state-checkpoints#REQ-3515]].
; Acceptance gate: [[SPEC-035-cached-state-checkpoints#TEST-3519]].
;
; Orientation: rowproof and compactproof establish sufficient retained state
; independently; composition connects every supported field to the existing
; typed native kernel. Bridge checks the Rust/model correspondence boundary;
; audit requires independent proof/assumption review before formal acceptance.
; The runtime summary cannot carry or close over all original history bodies.
; Native CBCL.State.Act and CBCL.StateKernelClause meanings are reference types.
; Completed IMPL-027 runtime tasks are not evidence that these proof tasks passed.
