; Planning ledger (owner / observable TEST-3519 acceptance / prerequisites):
; rowproof: kernel proof maintainer / live+pending invariant, duplicate and pruning
;   lemmas instantiated to native acts, checked without placeholders / none.
; compactproof: compact-rule proof maintainer / bounded Initial witnesses and plain
;   LWW recognized maximum linked to existing native semantics / none.
; composition: kernel proof maintainer / complete supported-rule render/advance
;   theorem over shared identity coverage / rowproof + compactproof.
; bridge: state-kernel conformance maintainer / independently derived parity vectors
;   and counterexamples, with extraction/codec/crypto exclusions / composition.
; audit: independent reviewer / checked theorem dependencies and non-circularity,
;   source-bound Lean build and bridge evidence, explicit residual trust / composition + bridge.
;
; Extend ONLY the existing spec-035-cached-checkpoints theory, one form per assert.
; Reuse its task/ready/completed/no-deps/verified built-ins and its already declared
; task-description/2 and task-acceptance/2. Document those declarations; do not
; redefine predicates or infer proof completion from the old acceptance task.
(meta (predicate task-description 2) (description "Work statement and producing role for an existing task; consumed by elephant next"))
(meta (predicate task-acceptance 2) (description "TEST-derived observable completion evidence for an existing task; consumed by elephant next"))

